==Trivia==
The illustration rare print of this card features each of {{p|Rotom}}'s {{form|Rotom|forms}}: Heat Rotom, Wash Rotom, Frost Rotom, Fan Rotom, and Mow Rotom.

===Origin===
*'''Assault Laser''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Phantom Forces|Manectric-EX|23}} from the {{TCG|Phantom Forces}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

